# Enterprise Cyber Risk Register

## Overview

Developed an enterprise cybersecurity risk register to identify, assess, prioritize, and monitor cybersecurity, operational, and compliance risks.

## Scope

- Identity & Access Management
- Vulnerability Management
- Third-Party Risk Management
- Cloud Security
- Compliance & Audit
- Incident Response
- Business Continuity & Disaster Recovery

## Deliverables

- Risk Register
- Risk Scoring Matrix
- Risk Treatment Plans
- Risk Ownership Assignment

## Frameworks Referenced

- ISO 27001:2022
- NIST Cybersecurity Framework
- CIS Controls

## Key Outcomes

- 34 identified cybersecurity risks
- Risk prioritization using likelihood-impact methodology
- Defined mitigation and residual risk strategies
- Governance and compliance alignment
